00:01:04.170 --> 00:01:05.760
Do you have this book?

00:01:05.760 --> 00:01:07.590
Yes, over this way.

00:01:07.590 --> 00:01:10.350
Okay, one for everyone, then, please.

00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:10.350
<b>Crowd</b>

00:01:10.350 --> 00:01:12.780
<i>Everyone?!</i>

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:15.810
<b>Staff Only</b>

00:01:13.720 --> 00:01:15.820
<b>An INQUIRY</b>

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:18.090
And so, the shelves are empty.

00:01:18.090 --> 00:01:19.720
That happens.

00:01:19.720 --> 00:01:24.510
As soon as the customers leave the shelf, 
the books that were there are gone.

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:27.330
