00:03:38.200 --> 00:03:40.630
Dude, you're just lost?!

00:03:40.870 --> 00:03:42.690
That building! Brown! Turn!

00:03:42.690 --> 00:03:43.760
Ah, okay!

00:03:43.760 --> 00:03:45.330
Really? Are you sure?

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:47.770
Obrigado!

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:47.770
