00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.140
<i>I'll have to continue responding 
with sincerity to customers</i>

00:03:55.140 --> 00:03:58.600
<i>who come at me so sincerely...</i>

00:03:58.600 --> 00:03:59.610
